# Force LF line endings for everything, regardless of the platform's core.autocrlf setting.
# Several files here are shell scripts executed by Docker RUN heredocs (Containerfile) or as
# the enclave's own init target (enclave-server/src/nautilus-server/run.sh) inside a minimal
# busybox environment -- CRLF in either breaks the shell parser. Checking this repo out on
# Windows with core.autocrlf=true silently reintroduces CRLF and re-breaks the enclave build;
# this file is what prevents that regression. Must be the first thing committed.
* text=auto eol=lf
